        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Taylor Swift, Max Martin, Shellback, Miley Cyrus\n- Songs: \"Wildest Dreams\", \"Dooo It!\"\n- Events: 2015 MTV Video Music Awards, pre-show\n- Roles: host, songwriter, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Taylor Swift co-wrote the song \"Wildest Dreams\" with its producers Max Martin and Shellback.\n- On August 30, 2015, the music video for Taylor Swift's \"Wildest Dreams\" premiered during the pre-show for the 2015 MTV Video Music Awards.\n- On August 30, 2015, Miley Cyrus premiered \"Dooo It!\" with a live performance during the 2015 MTV Video Music Awards, which she hosted.\n- On August 30, 2015, Miley Cyrus released \"Dooo It!\" online for free without prior announcement alongside its parent album.",
